 broken\nindentation in the live notebook and remirrored\; verified a 
 full\nend-to-end run with real market data in a codespace. Weekday 6am 
 and\n9:45am runs moved off Colab to the browser-driven codespace path 
 via\na selective cell runner.
DTSTAMP:20261013T185809Z
END:VEVENT
