UID:c6fb71b6-887f-45e9-a0b9-f7531e24021a@c6fb.org
DESCRIPTION:The full-mailbox census continued in rolling batches via the 
 direct\nread-only Gmail API route: 200 more messages read and 
 classified\n(3\,400 total)\, with tallies\, per-alias counts\, and a 
 needs-attention\nlist updated after every batch. No rate limits were hit. 
 Sharpest\nnew flags: a late-August payment-failure window wider than 
 first\nseen (cloud\, phone\, debit card\, and a coding-tool 
 subscription)\,\na client confirming an invoice payment\, an AI-training 
 platform\nonboarding requiring identity verification\, and two more\nnew-
 device sign-in notices in the late-August cluster.\nThe census pages on 
 from its saved checkpoint.
