DTSTART;TZID=/ics.py/2020.1/America/Toronto:20261013T144500
DURATION:PT1H30M
SUMMARY:Email census rolling run: stopped on rate limit at 3\,600 messages
UID:ce64bd49-6610-4860-9a5d-c8bcae9f3e0d@ce64.org
DESCRIPTION:The full-mailbox census rolling run resumed from its 
 saved\ncheckpoint via the direct read-only Gmail API route\, but 
 Google\nreturned a rate-limit response partway through the first 
 batch\nfetch\, with a retry-after time later that afternoon. Per 
 the\nstanding stop rule the run halted with no retries. No messages\nwere 
 tallied this run\; the checkpoint and resume token were\nleft unchanged so
  the next run re-fetches the batch losslessly.\nRunning total remains 
 3\,600 messages classified.\nThe census pages on from its saved 
 checkpoint.
DTSTAMP:20261013T185809Z
END:VEVENT
